# Junie (JetBrains AI agent) local & runtime artifacts.
# Shared config (guidelines.md, skills/, extensions.json) stays tracked;
# per-developer memory, per-task plans, and machine-local MCP config do not.
**/.junie/memory/
**/.junie/plans/
**/.junie/mcp/
packages/tokens/.*-size-verification.css.map

.env.local
